        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a46a400c-1d19-323c-b8d5-eeb97a115e73",
                "word": "вровень",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba2e00c8-e8ba-37bb-aa86-71e4e97409b8",
                        "entry_id": "a46a400c-1d19-323c-b8d5-eeb97a115e73",
                        "glosses": [
                            "на одном уровне с кем-либо или на одной линии с чем-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2040d440-44cb-46a1-8634-c8c5ab62ecb0",
                                "sense_id": "ba2e00c8-e8ba-37bb-aa86-71e4e97409b8",
                                "text": "— Кружку наливай вровень с краями и подноси левой рукой."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7cb2ca47-7806-4132-b1f1-b4ccac960158",
                                "sense_id": "ba2e00c8-e8ba-37bb-aa86-71e4e97409b8",
                                "text": "Он, не обращая на Райского внимания, переменил панталоны и сел в большом кресле, с ногами, так что коленки пришлись вровень с лицом."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56102609-f041-454f-80b8-9fdfc5a59eff",
                                "sense_id": "ba2e00c8-e8ba-37bb-aa86-71e4e97409b8",
                                "text": "Государь ехал по дороге, а я вровень с ним по горным тропинкам, пробитым параллельно дороге."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a78bd60-0006-42b5-b8e7-977df5fb195a",
                                "sense_id": "ba2e00c8-e8ba-37bb-aa86-71e4e97409b8",
                                "text": "Уверяли, напротив, и совершенно серьезно, что Лиза, взглянув на Николая Всеволодовича, быстро подняла руку, так-таки вровень с его лицом, и наверно бы ударила, если бы тот не успел отстраниться."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93ce7c32-4ae1-44b8-a5be-31b7b5c05101",
                                "sense_id": "ba2e00c8-e8ba-37bb-aa86-71e4e97409b8",
                                "text": "Я иду по глубокой дороге, и плечи мои вровень со снегами."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "994ccacf-00c7-34fe-a131-0f76e2d09176",
                        "entry_id": "a46a400c-1d19-323c-b8d5-eeb97a115e73",
                        "glosses": [
                            "одного роста с кем-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e459766-a3a2-4e13-91f3-14751ff6e1a8",
                                "sense_id": "994ccacf-00c7-34fe-a131-0f76e2d09176",
                                "text": "Наташка влезла на стул, чтобы быть вровень со всеми, и мы чокнулись."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffc9cf83-b775-4354-be38-765c5c75aaec",
                                "sense_id": "994ccacf-00c7-34fe-a131-0f76e2d09176",
                                "text": "Вон отворилась узкая, почти невидная дверца в звоннице, и показались двое, ростом вровень, только второй, что чуть позади, покрытый кожаным просторным фартуком, куда обширней, дюжей плечами, такой выскеть трехсотлетний, с дремучей окладистой смолевой бородою; ему бы палицу в руки, да и ступай в сторожу на границы."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f9fd07b-fbce-4faf-b903-044500c020ac",
                                "sense_id": "994ccacf-00c7-34fe-a131-0f76e2d09176",
                                "text": "Ты одна мне / ростом вровень, // стань же рядом / с бровью брови, // дай / про этот / важный вечер // рассказать / по-человечьи."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3362b588-3e31-360d-a18d-e86eaea88248",
                        "entry_id": "a46a400c-1d19-323c-b8d5-eeb97a115e73",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг. наравне, одинаково"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "18285e5d-1ba2-4873-96b5-847a131f3b80",
                                "sense_id": "3362b588-3e31-360d-a18d-e86eaea88248",
                                "text": "А я так себя считаю, что даже с дворецким могу быть вровень."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddb56bb4-a0ad-4237-82bd-3fc3e11829df",
                                "sense_id": "3362b588-3e31-360d-a18d-e86eaea88248",
                                "text": "Ветер запел в ушах вровень нижнему до на драндулете."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "203567d8-3f69-490e-a517-2d1c34465e8a",
                                "sense_id": "3362b588-3e31-360d-a18d-e86eaea88248",
                                "text": "Сколько заводов кругом, а ни один вровень не поставишь."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a316c33c-cfdc-4495-be17-f0d94d32b5b3",
                                "sense_id": "3362b588-3e31-360d-a18d-e86eaea88248",
                                "text": "— В походе вровень с нами страдали, вровень с нами орудия волокли, вровень пили и ели, да не вровень отчаивались."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "02adf7b6-9f1f-42b7-bb8f-0dd1250cba37",
                        "source_entry_id": "a46a400c-1d19-323c-b8d5-eeb97a115e73",
                        "target_lang_word": "nip and tuck",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nip and tuck",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f027899-7fd9-30ee-a47d-9d478489dcb0",
                                        "entry_id": "1198d5ce-7e5d-3123-b22c-192f480d7fbe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "So evenly matched that the advantage shifts from one to the other, and the outcome is uncertain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67ceacda-eeda-43fb-8ef5-82d5f84f11f2",
                                                "sense_id": "4f027899-7fd9-30ee-a47d-9d478489dcb0",
                                                "text": "It was nip and tuck with me between holding on to my stock and being sold out; but by great industry and prudence I managed to keep a little ahead and my mouth above water."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2da8a255-64e2-4f91-b934-1012b2d968bf",
                                                "sense_id": "4f027899-7fd9-30ee-a47d-9d478489dcb0",
                                                "text": "Bang! One saddle empty. Bang! another one. Bang—bang, and I bagged two. Well, it was nip and tuck with us, and I knew it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0be53678-1120-426a-87a4-b371fcb590b8",
                                                "sense_id": "4f027899-7fd9-30ee-a47d-9d478489dcb0",
                                                "text": "We broke away toward the north, the tribe howling on our track. Across the open spaces we gained, and in the brush they caught up with us, and more than once it was nip and tuck."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebe6d864-cd47-42e2-bb5b-8a34b74cd57b",
                                                "sense_id": "4f027899-7fd9-30ee-a47d-9d478489dcb0",
                                                "text": "1951, Howdy Doody's Christmas\nWell, it was nip and tuck, but everything worked out fine. Santa Claus got there in time to bring toys to all the boys and girls."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "nip and tuck",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8665b834-1d7e-38e7-943a-b669e804a1cb",
                                        "entry_id": "c73d5114-74f4-345d-b87a-83e1b5f83e3d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With the advantage of changing hands, or shifting back and forth among the available alternatives."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2789ed7-3494-41a6-b430-f3fa7821c106",
                                                "sense_id": "8665b834-1d7e-38e7-943a-b669e804a1cb",
                                                "text": "A man told me that they was both admitted to practice in the S'preme Court in '39, on the same day, sir. Then you know they was nip an' tuck after the same young lady."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d91dedf-6c92-4e09-915c-a7a2eb76d820",
                                                "sense_id": "8665b834-1d7e-38e7-943a-b669e804a1cb",
                                                "text": "\"I am glad I happened to reach him,\" he said, in an effort to relieve her embarrassment. \"We had it nip and tuck,\" he added, lightly. \"My lungs are lined with dust.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "365afa33-0a83-44fa-bb4c-3b80bc2bffec",
                                                "sense_id": "8665b834-1d7e-38e7-943a-b669e804a1cb",
                                                "text": "Obama's road to the White House was far from assured during the 2008 primary season when he ran nip and tuck with McCain in early Gallup Poll trial heats for the general election."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "nip and tuck",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb3d79ff-ab41-3b12-a481-875c1bfd77be",
                                        "entry_id": "acb23617-0fbe-3a82-94c5-4158246856d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Minor cosmetic surgery that tightens loose skin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0878f3fd-67bd-480a-9a35-7b357c1639ef",
                                                "sense_id": "fb3d79ff-ab41-3b12-a481-875c1bfd77be",
                                                "text": "I watch the show where Paris Hilton and Nikki Ritchie^([sic]) live the simple life. […] It's makeovers, nip and tucks, and shopping sprees."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a3af824b-8a30-40c0-9869-917c27758151",
                        "source_entry_id": "a46a400c-1d19-323c-b8d5-eeb97a115e73",
                        "target_lang_word": "neck and neck",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "neck and neck",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c1b6a11-a516-3c64-9e95-63e5ea6fe8d2",
                                        "entry_id": "835b2ddd-875d-3453-85ba-635de64adff7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very close in progress, as in a race or a contest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57c96953-f945-46fc-8cab-98ffd9e7a00b",
                                                "sense_id": "8c1b6a11-a516-3c64-9e95-63e5ea6fe8d2",
                                                "text": "The polls suggest that the candidates were neck and neck in the election."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26457547-f056-4261-b606-38e979511ab9",
                                                "sense_id": "8c1b6a11-a516-3c64-9e95-63e5ea6fe8d2",
                                                "text": "It lay between me and Dick Riot madam; we were neck and neck for three miles, as hard as we could lay leg to ground, and running every inch, but at the first, I felt for him, found I had the foot […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ba97bcd-b473-4136-a507-2609d9c884ce",
                                                "sense_id": "8c1b6a11-a516-3c64-9e95-63e5ea6fe8d2",
                                                "text": "Mr. Prendergast's Rainbow filly, watched closely by Paul Jones, took the lead, and they ran almost neck and neck until near the cords, when Paul Jones made a rush, and came home by a length."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ebd37a9-2029-49a5-9081-007f142a65bb",
                                                "sense_id": "8c1b6a11-a516-3c64-9e95-63e5ea6fe8d2",
                                                "text": "[...] Mr. M. N. Rollason points out that on four-track lines on which the fast lines, in the centre, are flanked by the slow lines, and running at speed is permissible on all four, the traveller can enjoy some quite exciting experiences when trains are doing a \"neck-and-neck\" on adjacent lines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04365185-5dcb-47b6-ba43-4b02fcf8d9be",
                                                "sense_id": "8c1b6a11-a516-3c64-9e95-63e5ea6fe8d2",
                                                "text": "Passing Iver, W.R. 4-6-0 No. 1012 County of Denbigh on the up \"Capitals United Express\" runs neck-and-neck with a parcels train headed by 4-6-0 No. 6821 Leaton Grange."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
